# Cloudflare and Netlify read this file; GitHub Pages ignores it. The old NotionNext
# paths live in `redirects` in novon.config.ts, which also writes a forwarding page
# for each of them, so they work on every host. A splat is the one thing only these
# hosts can do, so it stays here. The feed moved to /feed.xml: GitHub Pages picks the
# media type from the extension, and `/feed` came back as a download.
/page/*          /              301
/feed            /feed.xml      301